# Copied to /etc/raikiri/credentials.env, **chmod 0600, owned by root**.
#
# VALUES LIVE HERE AND NOWHERE ELSE. The gateway is handed `--api-key=env:NAME`,
# a reference, because a secret on a command line is a secret in `ps` for every
# account on the machine. systemd reads this file and passes it in the
# environment; argv never carries it.
#
# BINANCE_API_KEY=...
# BINANCE_API_SECRET=...
# OKX_API_KEY=...
# OKX_API_SECRET=...
# OKX_PASSPHRASE=...
